PURPOSE:
Form to rename, describe or deactivate a department.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Admin

ROUTE: /Admin/Departments/Edit/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load by id; POST Edit; audit changes.

DEPENDENCIES:
